{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/9fc013326c31a0078fbce65822978830.avif?t=1772224420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras_big/9fc013326c31a0078fbce65822978830.webp?t=1772224420 width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stance-driven, turn-based combo roguelike. Spend ACT to chain techniques, read the enemy, and turn defense into offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike. Survive. Evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/140496fde7771c33c97524ad8d2c9ff7.poster.avif?t=1772224420\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/140496fde7771c33c97524ad8d2c9ff7.webm?t=1772224420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/140496fde7771c33c97524ad8d2c9ff7.mp4?t=1772224420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/67a9de360f992ae99374e2da7d30e856.avif?t=1772224420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras_big/67a9de360f992ae99374e2da7d30e856.webp?t=1772224420 width=1560 height=240 /></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br>Combine a variety of moves to conquer hordes of demons! Strike while defending. Parry while striking. Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee. Each time you survive, you master a new art.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Spend ACT</strong> to unleash techniques and build custom combos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover synergies</strong> (e.g., land a Backspin Kick on a knocked-back enemy for huge bonus damage).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose stances</strong> that turn the enemy\u2019s turn into your opening\u2014deflect, counter, punish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/906b427b730225ac0be260b631a3250b.poster.avif?t=1772224420\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/906b427b730225ac0be260b631a3250b.webm?t=1772224420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/906b427b730225ac0be260b631a3250b.mp4?t=1772224420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/fba97544e0d78530359a3d57bf22a235.avif?t=1772224420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras_big/fba97544e0d78530359a3d57bf22a235.webp?t=1772224420 width=1560 height=170 /></span>A foot clad in steel boots delivers a powerful kick\u2014but a hand holding the legendary holy sword won\u2019t throw a punch. Food that restores HP may be the most valuable item in the dungeon... but don\u2019t overlook those that enhance your abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, wielding a weapon in one hand and kicking with the other can be your path to victory.<br>Adapt your equipment and techniques to forge a battle style that is uniquely your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/9eb9044adbd4ad8186e8844544aa058f.poster.avif?t=1772224420\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/9eb9044adbd4ad8186e8844544aa058f.webm?t=1772224420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/9eb9044adbd4ad8186e8844544aa058f.mp4?t=1772224420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras/32e18320a488d1df2f0a0d0f2e19a992.avif?t=1772224420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671740/extras_big/32e18320a488d1df2f0a0d0f2e19a992.webp?t=1772224420 width=1560 height=233 /></span><strong> </strong><br>You\u2019re cast into the abyss with nothing but your body\u2014forced to serve a<strong> \u201cDungeon Sentence\u201d\u2014a brutal punishment that throws you into the abyss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have a way to survive: <strong>karate</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep below lies a rumored <strong>\u201cpower of God.\u201d</strong><br>What is it\u2014and can you return to the surface alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters and unknown horrors, make allies where you can, and punch your way toward the truth at the bottom of the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live it. Fight it. With your fists.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671740?t=1772224420","background_raw":"https://s